    |not phi|_bit - |phi|_bit = 4 (= b_s)
(2) one-line derivations of not phi_w from {not phi_v}, |w| <= 8 (511 words): rejected by kcore 0, by rk 0; code length != |phi_w|_bit + b_s + 4: 0
    Structural lower bound (Def 5.1): every code has >= 1 line tag (2 bits), the end tag (2 bits) and the last formula, so l^bit_p(psi) >= |psi|_bit + 4 for every p. With (2), on D^0 the AI loss is kappa*sum(|phi|_bit+b_s+4)+O(1).
